Subject: [PATCH] sprd: bind the camera power domain on UMS9620 (qogirn6pro)

Changxing 60 (UMS9620/qogirn6pro) names the same camera subsystem node
"sprd,qogirn6pro-camsys-domain" and already carries the identical
force/automatic/state register triples and the clk_mm_eb gate. Match that
compatible so PD_CAMERA (and the ISP/DCAM banks) are shut down at probe and
stay off across system suspend. Without it the bootloader's camera domain
stays powered and the AP never enters PMU deep sleep. Do not change suspend
policy, radio operation, polling or eMMC sleep.

--- a/drivers/soc/sprd/domain/sprd_camsys_pd.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/sprd/domain/sprd_camsys_pd.c
@@ -208,6 +208,7 @@ static int camsys_pd_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct of_device_id camsys_pd_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "sprd,qogirl6l-camsys-domain" },
+	{ .compatible = "sprd,qogirn6pro-camsys-domain" },
 	{ }
 };
 static struct platform_driver camsys_pd_driver = {
